## Third-party components

This application can be built against optional Libretro emulator cores
distributed under their own licenses (typically GPL v2 or GPL v3). Those
cores are NOT included in this repository and are NOT bundled with the
MIT-licensed source code; users who choose to fetch them are responsible
for complying with each core's individual license terms when redistributing
a compiled binary.

This application does NOT include any copyrighted game software (ROMs),
BIOS files, or firmware. Users are solely responsible for ensuring they
possess the legal right to any files they load into the application.
